& [TypeGraph] is closed for canonicalization
  + AcquisitionIdentity is a private nonzero u64 logical-correlation wrapper with strict serde and no generator
  + AcquisitionScopeClaim is one strict caller-decodable complete comparison product
  + CompletionDisposition has exactly CompleteClaimed
  + AcquisitionLineageClaim owns identity, scope, disposition, and one complete current ordered-digest carrier
  + CausalOrderKind has exactly FirstCompletionStrictlyPrecedesSecondStart
  + CausalOrderClaim binds exact first and second acquisition identities and the closed kind
  + OrderedAcquisitionPairClaim owns exact first and second lineage claims plus one causal-order claim
  + RepeatedInventoryEvidencePlan binds exact profile, ordered pair, exact current reconciliation plan, and requested NonAtomicRepeatedInventoryEqual
  + RepeatedInventoryEvidenceClaim is output-only and retains complete ordered pair, reconciliation input, current reconciliation result, requested grade, and ClaimOnly provenance
  + AcquisitionLineageFault owns one closed code, one bounded field, and one bounded message

& [ScopeProduct] is complete and structural
  + exact candidate root reference
  + exact strong root identity
  + exact canonical root volume-GUID path
  + scanner profile cantor-windows-candidate-topology/0.1
  + machine forms profile cantor-phase3-machine-forms/0.2
  + topology forms profile cantor-phase3-topology-forms/0.3
  + topology receipt profile cantor-phase3-topology-receipt/0.3 where the receipt relation is claimed
  + exact current topology inventory assembly profile
  + exact current ordered topology inventory digest profile
  + exact current ordered digest reconciliation profile
  + exact current ordered observation encoding profile
  + one complete TopologyScanLimits value
  + one closed policy digest
  + exact predecessor admission profile and predecessor receipt digest
  + equality compares every coordinate and no separate comparison-scope identity exists

& [IdentityModel] is noninflating
  + zero is invalid and every other u64 value is syntactically well formed
  + equality and inequality support correlation and exact role distinction only
  + representation is canonical, allocation-free, bounded, and round-trip stable
  + collision domain, generation, uniqueness, event occurrence, producer identity, and physical origin remain M2C responsibilities

& [LineageOwnership] is single sourced
  + each lineage owns exactly one complete ordered-digest carrier
  + the carrier owns its current inventory assembly and every transitive supplied ancestor
  + no peer assembly, bare digest, external locator, lookup key, mutable pointer, or summary is stored
  + current validators and derivations are rerun before the lineage is accepted
  + a carrier remains supplied semantic data and does not become an observation by ownership

& [PairAndOrderModel] is exact
  + pair cardinality is exactly two with named FirstAcquisition and SecondAcquisition fields
  + identities must differ and complete scope products must be structurally equal
  + causal relation endpoints must equal the pair identities in exact roles
  + direction is first completion to second start and cannot be inferred from order, operand, or numeric value
  + no clock, timestamp, tick, duration, freshness, or occurrence proof is represented

& [ReconciliationModel] is subordinate
  + current exact reconciliation plan consumes the pair's complete digest carriers in explicit mapped operand roles
  + each carrier is independently validated and rederived
  + current common reconciliation scope must match the complete acquisition scope
  + current result is Equal or Different and retains complete operand lineage
  + only Equal can release the requested ClaimOnly result
  + Different is a bounded denial of repeated equality and says nothing about physical change timing or fault

& [ProvenanceModel] has no upward conversion
  + ClaimForm is public inspectable supplied data
  + ValidClaim is deterministic pure structural and relational success
  + ClaimOnly is output-only pure derivation with complete inspectable ancestry
  + ProductionAdmittedLineage is absent
  + IssuedEvidence is absent
  + IssuedReceipt is absent
  + ConsumptionDecision is absent
  + no serde, private field, validation, rederivation, Equal result, or serialization crosses an absent boundary

& [SerializationAndVisibility] are strict
  + every serialized struct denies unknown fields
  + input claims derive Serialize and Deserialize with no alias, default, flatten, untagged, catch-all, or compatibility fallback
  + closed enums expose exact variants only
  + output result fields are private with immutable getters and Serialize only
  + output Deserialize, Default, public constructor, From, Into, and direct TopologyReceipt conversion are absent
  + synthetic construction remains cfg(test) or ordinary pure derivation over declared claim inputs

& [ValidationOrder] is deterministic
  + V01 validate outer profile and requested capability
  + V02 validate first then second acquisition identity syntax and bounds
  + V03 validate first then second complete scope through current nested forms
  + V04 require both completion dispositions CompleteClaimed
  + V05 validate and independently rederive first then second complete carrier lineage
  + V06 require distinct identities and exact structural scope equality
  + V07 validate causal relation kind, endpoints, direction, and nonself relation
  + V08 validate exact current reconciliation plan and operand binding
  + V09 independently rerun current reconciliation and preserve its typed faults
  + V10 require Equal and requested NonAtomicRepeatedInventoryEqual
  + V11 release one complete ClaimOnly output or the first atomic bounded fault

& [FaultModel] is closed
  + InvalidRequest covers malformed outer request or unsupported outer capability
  + Profile covers exact profile mismatch
  + Identity covers zero, duplicate, or role-mismatched acquisition identity
  + Scope covers invalid or unequal complete scope
  + Lineage covers incomplete, stale, mismatched, bare, or invalid carrier ancestry
  + Order covers absent, wrong-role, self, inverse, cyclic, or unsupported relation
  + Reconciliation preserves current validation or derivation denial
  + Different preserves valid current non-equality
  + Evidence covers unsupported grade or self-authorization attempt
  + Resource covers declared bound failure
  + Capability is absent because no producer-admission operation exists
  + every fault is one bounded atomic denial with no partial result

& [CardinalityAndResources] are finite
  + one profile and one plan
  + exactly two acquisition identities, scopes, and lineage roles
  + exactly one causal edge
  + exactly two complete current carrier lineages
  + exactly one reconciliation plan and result
  + exactly one requested evidence grade and one output provenance grade
  + existing entry, path, stream, file, total, carrier, profile, field, and diagnostic bounds are reused
  + new identity storage is one u64 and no unbounded vector, map, recursion, arbitrary JSON, or free diagnostic exists

& [StateModel] is governance monotonic and runtime empty
  + current source_preserved to audited to exploded to refined to constrained to pruned_threat_reviewed to seven_fold_locked to data_designed
  + later justified to planned to registered to canonicalized to artifact_phase_locked to implementation_signed
  + no current state is implemented, acquired, admitted, issued, consumed, mutated, sealed, promoted, or physically proven

& [VersionAndCompatibility] are exact
  + candidate profile 0.1 is additive and independent
  + every nested current profile is named and exact
  + existing public types, carrier ownership, Cargo, and lockfile remain unchanged
  + there is no compatibility decoder, alias, migration, or live state conversion
  + future producer admission or effect profile requires new source and separate authority

& [EffectModel] is empty
  + no unsafe, platform, filesystem, handle, pointer, clock, random, process, environment, network, persistence, database, Git runtime, model, tool, or fixture execution
  + no acquisition, admission, issuance, consumption, mutation, seal, cleanup, promotion, neural, distributed, or FPGA action
  + pure CPU and bounded memory would be permitted only after an exact later implementation signature

& [DataQualityGate] passes
  + all fourteen requirements map to a settled conceptual type or proof boundary
  + all twenty-four constraints reapply without collision
  + all fourteen threat probes are denied or separately deferred
  + all seven folds converge on the same ownership, provenance, and effect model
